/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_Foundation Foundation
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Portable C++ base library for desktop and embedded consumers.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | General-purpose types, containers, math, time, callbacks, scheduling, and utilities |
 * | Current release | [`v2.0.7`](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/Foundation/releases/tag/v2.0.7) |
 * | Status | Stable 2.x foundation layer |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/Foundation](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/Foundation) |
 * | Documentation | [Foundation on GitHub Pages](https://checheromo96.github.io/Foundation/) |
 * | Build infrastructure | RoModularBuild `v0.6.2` |
 * | Runtime dependency | CPSTL `1.1.11` or a compatible newer 1.x release |
 * | Public CMake target | `Foundation::Foundation` |
 *
 * Foundation supplies general-purpose facilities above CPSTL to RoModular
 * libraries. It targets desktop and embedded systems without depending on any
 * music-domain repository. Its own documentation is authoritative for API,
 * platform support, packages, examples, testing, and known limitations.
 */

